# Font Licenses

The WOFF2 files are lossless format conversions (fontTools, no glyph or table changes) of the
upstream TTF releases named below.

## Manrope (font-family: 'Manrope')

Manrope is licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.

Source: https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Manrope
Copyright: (c) 2019-2024 Mikhail Shardin (mikhailshardin@gmail.com)

Files: manrope-400.woff2, manrope-500.woff2, manrope-600.woff2, manrope-700.woff2, manrope-800.woff2

## IBM Plex Sans (font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans')

IBM Plex Sans is licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.

Source: https://fonts.google.com/specimen/IBM+Plex+Sans
Copyright: (c) 2017-2024 IBM Corp. and contributors

Files: ibm-plex-sans-400.woff2, ibm-plex-sans-500.woff2, ibm-plex-sans-600.woff2

